OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged with murder after
OL,4,Afootballer death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter the death of a footballer.
OL,9,FA post-mortem examination found Hendon
OL,10,FFC player Ezekiel Williams, 26, from
OL,11,FLondon, died in hospital from head
OL,12,Finjuries after an incident in the early
OL,13,Fhours of Sunday in Midsummer Boulevard,
OL,14,FMilton Keynes.
OL,16,FThames Valley Police said Sameull
OL,17,FHussein, 28, of no fixed abode, and
OL,18,FArman Uddin, 21, of Saxon Road, Luton,
OL,19,Fwere both charged with one count of
OL,20,Fmurder on Thursday night.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
